Local OpenGrep/Semgrep rule pack for the Secure SDLC Control Plane.

Contents:
  common/            Language-agnostic rules (secrets, generic patterns)
  <lang>/            Rules scoped to a detected language
  vendor/aikido/     Vendored third-party rules (see vendor/aikido/SOURCE)

Loading:
  The OpenGrep adapter always loads common/ plus the directories matching the
  detected languages, then any rules under vendor/. Files are passed to the
  engine in sorted order for deterministic, offline scanning.

License:
  Rules under common/ and the language directories are authored for this
  project. Third-party rules are isolated under vendor/ with their original
  license and source attribution preserved.
